      "text": "Detected in 1 minute. Cause isolated, config disabled \u2014 95% of the network normal again by minute 49. Permanent fix shipped in under 8 hours.",
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Detected in 1 minute. Cause isolated, config disabled \u2014 95% of the network normal again by minute 49. Permanent fix shipped in under 8 hours.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
