      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Total: ~1 hour of visible impact, 85% of Fastly's global network affected at peak, fixed inside 49 minutes. Longer-term fix: heavier investment in WebAssembly-based isolation in Compute@Edge, so one customer's configuration can't cascade into everyone else's traffic. \"Fast, global propagation is the product. It's also the blast radius.\"",
